      "observation": "All four expanded editor captures fit their card width without clipping. 1/5/10-minute presets, selected 5-minute state, custom numeric field, 1\u2013240 whole-minute helper, explicit Save 5 min daily allowance and Remove time limit are legible. Renewal, start on child library opening, no rollover, and preserved Parent stop/pause are stated. The elapsed background countdown distinction appears in the editor.",
