      "area": "Responsive layout and navigation",
      "observation": "Parent phone stacks cards; portrait and landscape tablets show two columns; desktop adds a left navigation rail. Time has a clear selected state throughout. Mixed four-child pages keep names, state labels and controls attached to each child. Spacing and line icons remain consistent; labels fit touch-height buttons.",
